        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin Bacon, Curtis Hanson, Meryl Streep, David Strathairn, John C. Reilly, Benjamin Bratt, Joseph Mazzello\n- Films: The River Wild, Footloose, JFK, A Few Good Men, Apollo 13, Mystic River\n\nFacts:\n- Kevin Bacon was born on July 8, 1958, and he is an American actor and musician.\n- Footloose is a 1984 musical-drama film that is one of Kevin Bacon's notable films.\n- JFK is a 1991 historical conspiracy legal thriller that is one of Kevin Bacon's notable films.\n- A Few Good Men is a 1992 legal drama that is one of Kevin Bacon's notable films.\n- The River Wild is a 1994 American adventure crime-thriller film directed by Curtis Hanson and starring Meryl Streep, Kevin Bacon, David Strathairn, John C. Reilly, Benjamin Bratt, and Joseph Mazzello as Roarke.\n- Apollo 13 is a 1995 historical docudrama that is one of Kevin Bacon's notable films.\n- Mystic River is a 2003 mystery drama that is one of Kevin Bacon's notable films.",
